  "sourceFacts": {
    "horizontalBasis": "Named Topkapi Q170495 member OSM way194486642 v17 / native35184566575474, explicitly Sofa Köşkü/Sofa Pavilion. No separate Wikidata tag was present in the standard map identity preflight, so retain the site QID with this independent way. Exact twelve-corner canopy retained. Internal+X southeast orders the glazed hall then taller ornamental room; internal-Z northeast faces the photographed central garden stair.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Picture-led elevated walking floor3.3100118364189455m relative to uncovered provider,3.15m above the highest native canopy boundary. Glazed hall eaves4.55m above floor; ornamental wing5.35m; shallow lead hips1.05/1.15m. Two-room partition follows exact mapped wings/connector. Roof pitches,18support positions, window/frame ornament inventory, back wall/floor arrangement and room heights are reconstruction controls, not surveyed dimensions."
